<title>THAILAND: United Palm Oil audited 1996 profits up.</title>
<headline>United Palm Oil audited 1996 profits up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for United Palm Oil for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>			 (In millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  For 12 months</p>
<p>				     1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   7.17	     4.72</p>
<p>    Net			  232.35	   152.89</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter figures not stated. Company's full name is United Palm Oil Plc. The company produces palm oil. ($1 = 26 baht) -- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
